<title>USA: SIOUX FALLS CATTLE STEADY/$0.50 LOWER - USDA.</title>
<headline>SIOUX FALLS CATTLE STEADY/$0.50 LOWER - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers were steady-$0.50 lower in moderately active trade. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers:  High Select and Choice 2-3 1200-1300 lbs 64.00-65.50.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers:  High Select and Choice 2-3 1025-1150 lbs 64.00-64.50 early.</p>
